OL,3,GNEWSADead woman named in murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the murder of a
OL,7,Fwoman in Alderney have named her as
OL,8,F34-year-old Hannah Benfield.
OL,10,FHer body was found in the sea at the
OL,11,Fbase of cliffs on the western end of
OL,12,Fthe Channel Island in an area known as
OL,13,FThe Guns early on Monday. A 44-year-old
OL,14,Fman was later arrested on suspicion of
OL,15,Fmurder and remains in police custody.
OL,17,FGuernsey Police said "the impact of an
OL,18,Fincident of this nature" on Alderney's
OL,19,Fsmall, close-knit community "cannot be
OL,20,Foverstated".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
