OL,3,GNEWSADead woman named in murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said specialist family liaison
OL,7,Fofficers had been supporting Benfield's
OL,8,Frelatives. The force said the family
OL,9,Fhad asked for privacy as they came to
OL,10,Fterms with what had happened.
